              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Widiyana Sudirman"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is by far my favorite salad dressing! Salty and light with a tangy taste all the way. I reduce the usage of oil by 25% to get a thicker concentrate. I will definitely make this again next week!",
